# Environment "udpipe": UDPipe 2 with its models of release 2.17 (supplementary.qmd S3), served by
# intract_features.parse.udpipe_server around the unmodified udpipe2_server.py of ufal/udpipe@223da86.
# These are the pins of the error model's udpipe2 environment (presub error_model/env/udpipe2.in), whose
# fresh-server reruns on L40S were byte-identical in 46 of 46 files; udpipe.lock keeps every version of
# that environment's lock. TensorFlow 2.21 cannot share an environment with core's torch stack.
